<title>USA: Angstrom Technologies sees Q1 profit.</title>
<headline>Angstrom Technologies sees Q1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>ERLANGER, Ky. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Angstrom Technologies Inc said it will post a profit during the first quarter of fiscal 1997, based on preliminary results that show sales exceeded $400,000.</p>
<p>The company did not say what the profit would be, however. An official from the company declined to comment.</p>
<p>The company posted a loss for the year ended December 31 of $0.03 per share, compared with $0.02 per share in 1995.</p>
</text>
